00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T22:46:15Z","body":"`move_and_collide` is a method inherited from CollisionObject2D/3D, it's not specific to CharacterBody2D/3D and it does not interact with its `velocity`. It *does* require its delta to be multiplied when moving every frame.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3363486064/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3378281801","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109925#issuecomment-3378281801","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109925","id":3378281801,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JXH1J","user":{"login":"MadeScientist","id":190612698,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1yE2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190612698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist","html_url":"https://github.com/MadeScientist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T18:49:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T18:49:50Z","body":"I think the focus of your problem is not on the unit, but on clearly stating in